us/1768998561557942425"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-16T06:09:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1768882301700600301"],"id":"1768882301700600301","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":186130,"like_count":65,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"好久没喝霸王茶姬了~ https://t.co/88hQCuoAax","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1768882301700600301"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-15T13:08:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1768625436169322651"],"id":"1768625436169322651","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":134,"impression_count":1064641,"like_count":1536,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":129,"retweet_count":20},"text":"男友想试试颜射\n我配合他跪在他面前\n我想偷懒，就让他自己手冲\n其实我蛮紧张的\n背着手闭上眼在那等着\n听着他撸动和喘气的声音\n半天也没动静\n我刚打算睁一只眼，瞟下什么情况\n突然脸上热热的\n我吓了一跳，嗅着浓重的石楠花味\n我擦拭掉睫毛上的白浊\n给了他JJ一巴掌\n“下次要射的时候能不能提前说一声！？”","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1768625436169322651"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-13T06:08:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1767794758229918104"],"id":"1767794758229918104","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":97,"impression_count":1170484,"like_count":1816,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":83,"retweet_count":16},"text":"今天中午同桌欣喜地告诉我，他发现一个叫“X”（推特）的软件，上面好多好看的，把主页各种新闻梗图画作还夹杂着一些色图都给我看。我只敢在旁边假装惊讶地附和，一起感慨墙外居然有这么多有趣的东西。\n其实我心里虚得不行，怕突然刷到我。他估计也想不到，平时上课旁边坐着的我就是个十万粉大黄推。。。","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1767794758229918104"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-12T05:52:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1767428308533162349"],"id":"1767428308533162349","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":322203,"like_count":208,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":50,"retweet_count":1},"text":"室友问我怎么瘦下来的\n我：我经常手冲。。。 https://t.co/SGyM1MUx6f","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1767428308533162349"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-11T15:36:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1767212946881483248"],"id":"1767212946881483248","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":94,"impression_count":1219592,"like_count":1208,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":141,"retweet_count":4},"text":"我操，我看到一个我们学校的女生也在推特当福利姬，粉丝比我还多😨😨😨😨😨","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1767212946881483248"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-11T06:37:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1767077459395002493"],"id":"1767077459395002493","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":391327,"like_count":565,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":80,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我怀疑有些人入我门槛是来进货的。。。上个月还在要我照片来打手冲的门槛哥，现在却看到他摇身一变，换上了粉嫩滤镜的动漫女头，成了天天在朋友圈发各种腿照柰子的擦边妹。。。","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1767077459395002493"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-09T15:32:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1766487291722133646"],"id":"1766487291722133646","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":78,"impression_count":622557,"like_count":989,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":83,"retweet_count":16},"text":"每次给男朋友口交。我会在他还还没硬起来的时候，就把软软的肉棒含到嘴里，然后慢慢感受它勃起长大，一点点填满我的嘴，挺有趣的。","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1766487291722133646"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-09T12:53:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1766447258583601530"],"id":"1766447258583601530","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":775,"impression_count":802627,"like_count":2713,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":120},"text":"写作业累了。。偷偷zw奖励一下自己，好爽。。。\n\n# 女喘   # 手冲实录 https://t.co/aWmc5HRnIo","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1766447258583601530"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-08T14:29:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1766108877043425749"],"id":"1766108877043425749","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":133,"impression_count":1760048,"like_count":1369,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":299,"retweet_count":12},"text":"男生硬了一定要射出来才舒服吗？？？","url":"https://x.com/odelia21360/status/1766108877043425749"},{"author_id":"1717128756207235072","created_at":"2024-03-07T06:01:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["17656188